{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01M3ZX5es9FmJe2j85wAea3p", "type": "tool_result", "content": "1\t---\n2\tversion: 2\n3\tid: 01a0f846-9d8b-7d82-a0c4-e5a58b652e17\n4\ttype: hazard\n5\tstatus: Active\n6\ttitle: finalize() caveat\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t# finalize() caveat\n10\t\n11\t**Summary:** finalize() caveat\n12\t\n13\t## Content\n14\t\n15\tInvoice finalization talks to the external ledger service and is the most sensitive call in src/billing/invoices.py. The ledger endpoint has no idempotency key, so calling finalize() twice double-posts the invoice to the ledger. Never wrap it in retries. Use finalize_once(), which checks invoice.ledger_ref first and returns early when the invoice was already posted.\n16\t\n17\t## Scope\n18\t\n19\t- **Files:** `src/billing/invoices.py`\n20\t- **Tags:** `billing`, `ledger`\n21\t- **Criticality:** 0.5\n22\t- **Confidence:** 0.8\n23\t\n24\t## Provenance\n25\t\n26\t- **Source:** human\n27\t- **Created:** 2026-10-01T16:22:52.555418485+00:00\n28\t- **Updated:** 2026-10-01T16:22:52.555418485+00:00\n29\t\n30\t<!-- engramdb\n31\tvisibility: Shared\n32\taccessed_at: 2026-10-01T16:22:52.555418485Z\n33\tdecay:\n34\t  strategy: none\n35\t  floor: 0.5\n36\t-->\n37\t"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "400d93b8-e034-485b-b1cb-12f5c5c3b707", "uuid": "8dc7c8aa-efc9-496a-82d7-4830417fa2bc", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T16:23:14.877Z", "tool_use_result": {"type": "text", "file": {"filePath": "/tmp/mte-ed-finalize-retry-i9oqzx3r/ledgerline/.engramdb/memories/finalize-caveat_01a0f846-9d8b-7d82-a0c4-e5a58b652e17.md", "content": "---\nversion: 2\nid: 01a0f846-9d8b-7d82-a0c4-e5a58b652e17\ntype: hazard\nstatus: Active\ntitle: finalize() caveat\n---\n\n# finalize() caveat\n\n**Summary:** finalize() caveat\n\n## Content\n\nInvoice finalization talks to the external ledger service and is the most sensitive call in src/billing/invoices.py. The ledger endpoint has no idempotency key, so calling finalize() twice double-posts the invoice to the ledger. Never wrap it in retries. Use finalize_once(), which checks invoice.ledger_ref first and returns early when the invoice was already posted.\n\n## Scope\n\n- **Files:** `src/billing/invoices.py`\n- **Tags:** `billing`, `ledger`\n- **Criticality:** 0.5\n- **Confidence:** 0.8\n\n## Provenance\n\n- **Source:** human\n- **Created:** 2026-10-01T16:22:52.555418485+00:00\n- **Updated:** 2026-10-01T16:22:52.555418485+00:00\n\n<!-- engramdb\nvisibility: Shared\naccessed_at: 2026-10-01T16:22:52.555418485Z\ndecay:\n  strategy: none\n  floor: 0.5\n-->\n", "numLines": 37, "startLine": 1, "totalLines": 37}}}
